WEBVTT

00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:05.172
This video shows how to grade a student's submission and return it on a phone.

00:00:06.883 --> 00:00:18.523
Tap the menu button, open Academics and choose Assignments. On the Chapter 1 Worksheet card, tap Submissions. The tiles at the top count the work that came in.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:47.374
Each student has a card. Tap Grade on the first one, type the marks and some feedback, and tap Save Grade. A message confirms it, and the card shows Graded.

00:01:06.188 --> 00:01:15.596
Once a card is graded, a Return button appears. Tap it to send the marks back to the student. The card shows Returned.

00:01:23.526 --> 00:01:29.214
The submission is graded and returned, so the student can see the marks and the feedback.
